  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Bete man æfre ærest þone griðbryce into ðare circan be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be þam þe þare circan mæð sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the first instance, amends for breach of its protection shall always be made to the church, in accordance with the nature of the offence and also in proportion to the status of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">gebete man ærest þæne griðbryce into ðære cyrcan, be þam þe seo dæd sy ⁊ be ðam þe ðære cyrcan mæð sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
